    "fig_partial_policy_deployment": "active two-panel randomized deployment replay over 589 BGP-observed route-origin pairs; one standalone legend is shared by two equal-height panels with identical canvas and axes geometry; each of 1,000 seeded rollouts independently orders downstream ROAs, root ROAs, and aggregate prefixes configured with S²-ROV policies; markers and lines report mean conflicting routes as a percentage of the same fixed 589-route denominator, no interval or range glyphs are drawn, and the curves are not historical Internet adoption trajectories",
    "fig_processing_cost": "active two-panel system-cost evidence: version-specific classification bars with a Throughput (routes/s) axis and 0/10000/20000/30000 ticks plus one grouped IPv4/IPv6 same-size policy-update panel at the same five total-record counts; the accepted run's load measurements remain historical and non-plotted; cross-version differences are descriptive, and the artifacts do not measure relying-party, RTR, router-installation, forwarding, or line-rate throughput"
  },
